  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kandadji-Niamey Transmission Line Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve the living conditions of the population and to support the economic growth of the Country thanks to a cheap and clean electricity supply and the revenues from the sales of the surplus of electricity.   

The project will, by 2020, provide 600 GWh per annum of clean, renewable and low cost electricity to the Fleuve Region, the main consumption center of Niger.</narrative>
  </description>
